{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brno Transit is a narrative-driven psychological horror game about a trainee metro driver trapped in the dampest subway east of anything that matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To begin your metro driver training, please come to the registry office. You'll find it in the vestibule of Divadlo station.\u00a0Bring your Certificate of Professional Competence.\u00a0For your first ride, check in with the shift supervisor at the depot. The rest will find you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Employee benefits include: crisp uniform, unlimited travel pass, meal vouchers, an annual trip to Bulgaria \u2014 and, if you prove yourself, an invitation to the Bunker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay sharp. Even a single mistake can get you into deep crap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476880/extras/af95b3254906f07893c37807e4f11808.poster.avif?t=1773845741\" width=520 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476880/extras/af95b3254906f07893c37807e4f11808.webm?t=1773845741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476880/extras/af95b3254906f07893c37807e4f11808.mp4?t=1773845741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3476880?t=1773845741","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3476880?t=1773845741","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476880/e49e5bfad4d6ac71e41618c3e4ea77bf34ffbff0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773845741","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.st